   I have ascended as an Elf. The key is that elves start off with pretty useful
intrinsics. When I ascended I was quite fortunate in that I started off with a blind fold
and 32 arrows. In the early levels I made extensive use of sleep resistance by tricking
monsters into chasing me over sleeping gas traps. Once I gained telepathy, the blind fold
was extremely useful since I could use the arrows at long range until the bad guys got close
and then was able to scamper away to safety with intrinsic speed.

  The Elf was a difficult ascension due to the fact that I had been playing a Caveman
previously and it took awhile to get used to being "discretionary rather than valorous"
in the early levels of the character.

  Obviously there as many ways to win with the Elf as there are hackers but this is what
worked for me.

